Wrong (A): Excess parachute payments are explicitly nondeductible under Section 280G regardless of whether the compensation is otherwise reasonable.
Wrong (B): The $1,500,000 threshold (three times the base amount) is the trigger for the parachute payment rules, not a deduction limit.
