  explanation = $EXPL$Correct (B): Under Section 1223(1), when a partner contributes a capital asset or Section 1231 property in a Section 721 exchange, the holding period of the partnership interest tacks onto the contributed property''s holding period. Since Reeves contributed a capital asset held for three years, her partnership interest includes that time.
Wrong (A): This incorrectly starts a new holding period at the contribution date, ignoring the tacking rule under Section 1223(1) for contributed capital assets.
Wrong (C): The partnership''s formation date is irrelevant. The holding period tacks from the contributed property, not from when the entity was formed.
